  "Comment": {
    "type": "cexostring",
    "value": "As of Q v2.1, the jump animation through chat command has been disabled due to an exploit that allowed PCs to jump through locked doors and walls. \r\n\r\nUse this trigger to allow a PC to use the chat command to jump from the location of the trigger. If the PC leaves the trigger then jumping is disabled again.\r\n\r\nWhen placing this trigger you must place a corresponding \"target\" waypoint that has the same tag as the trigger. Therefore, each trigger should have a unique tag."
